#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="kotlin"
DISPLAY_NAME="Kotlin / JVM"

DESCRIPTION:
Kotlin on the JVM — Spring Boot services, CLI tools, or Android (if
targeting Android, add android-specific rules to PROJECT_OVERRIDES).

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Language:      Kotlin 1.9+
- Runtime:       JVM 21 LTS
- Build:         Gradle 8.x with Kotlin DSL (build.gradle.kts)
- Test:          JUnit 5 + Kotest or MockK
- Lint:          Detekt
- Format:        ktlint

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.chloeai → .claude/rules/code.chloeai
- init-project.sh copies tests.chloeai → .claude/rules/tests.chloeai
- For Android projects, add android rules to ai_modules/hi_mode.chloeai PROJECT_OVERRIDES
